  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When I launch two clients for debugging purposes even though they are using different profiles they share the same configuration and log directory. As one of these is my normal account and one is a debug account I'd like to keep configurations, logs, and even caches  separate.\n\nThis could be something like the current default being \\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\..., but using \\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Profiles\\N\\... for different profiles, or a single config file with a profiles section which can add per-profile overrides, plus adding the ability to set logfile location and osc ports in the config; it could even be just a command-line option on what directory to use, though the launcher would need updates to properly support that.\n\nMy top desire is keeping the logs separate, but different sound, graphic, and permission settings would also be useful.",
